{"nodes": [{"id": "tec_single_vs_parallel_deployment_analysis_v1_0", "label": "TEC Single-Unit vs Multi-Unit Parallel Deployment Analysis v1.0", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "tec_single_vs_parallel_deployment_analysis_v1.0.pdf", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "tec_single_vs_parallel_deployment_analysis_v1_0_per_unit_rating", "label": "10 L/day as Per-Unit TEC AWG Rating at Nominal Psychrometric Conditions", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "tec_single_vs_parallel_deployment_analysis_v1.0.pdf", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Per-unit output is fixed in hardware by three constraints: Peltier cold-side duty ceiling, fan airflow capacity, and condenser surface area; manufacturers scale capacity by replicating units, not building monolithic larger ones. Clarifying per-unit vs aggregate changes the Benban deployment count by four orders of magnitude (10,322 units nominal)."}, {"id": "tec_single_vs_parallel_deployment_analysis_v1_0_architecture_a_monolithic", "label": "Architecture A - Single High-Capacity Monolithic TEC Assembly", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "tec_single_vs_parallel_deployment_analysis_v1.0.pdf", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Conceptual extreme only: no commercial continuous TEC product line exists between 10 L/day and 100,000 L/day."}, {"id": "tec_single_vs_parallel_deployment_analysis_v1_0_architecture_b_parallel", "label": "Architecture B - Multi-Unit Parallel TEC Deployment (N units, N+1 redundancy)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "tec_single_vs_parallel_deployment_analysis_v1.0.pdf", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The architecture industry actually implements: catalogue units manifolded into a common water plenum; single-tile failure degrades output marginally rather than catastrophically."}, {"id": "tec_single_vs_parallel_deployment_analysis_v1_0_psychrometric_derating", "label": "Psychrometric Derating Factor (eta_derate ~ 0.36 at Benban)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "tec_single_vs_parallel_deployment_analysis_v1.0.pdf", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Nameplate ratings assume 27C / 60% RH (13.33 g/kg); Benban's annual-mean humidity ratio of 4.844 g/kg derates a nominal 10 L/day unit to ~3.6 L/day (2.79 L/day in the driest month)."}], "edges": [{"source": "tec_single_vs_parallel_deployment_analysis_v1_0", "target": "project_awh_benban_numbers_cost_quality", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "tec_single_vs_parallel_deployment_analysis_v1.0.pdf", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "tec_single_vs_parallel_deployment_analysis_v1_0", "target": "egypt_pv_inventory_and_tec_small_scale", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "tec_single_vs_parallel_deployment_analysis_v1.0.pdf", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "tec_single_vs_parallel_deployment_analysis_v1_0", "target": "tec_single_vs_parallel_deployment_analysis_v1_0_per_unit_rating", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "tec_single_vs_parallel_deployment_analysis_v1.0.pdf", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "tec_single_vs_parallel_deployment_analysis_v1_0", "target": "tec_single_vs_parallel_deployment_analysis_v1_0_architecture_a_monolithic", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "tec_single_vs_parallel_deployment_analysis_v1.0.pdf", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "tec_single_vs_parallel_deployment_analys